// An array as a value, `initial state A if a do x += 1 go to A`. KIELER rejects it: assignment to ‘char’ from ‘int *’
// makes integer from pointer without a cast [-Wint-conversion].
scchart Main { input bool b input int i int a[2] = {4,7} int c[2] = {4,7} int m[2][2] = {{4,7},{8,1}} float fa[2] bool ba[2] output int x output float f output bool y  initial state A if a do x += 1 go to A }
